# An operator on numbers first makes numbers of its operands and then asks which form they allow. Under the word the walk of the loop is cut short at the making.
# The compiler died here: behind the cut the making answered nothing, and the form of nothing was asked for. A cut is taken up in front of the next operation of the input.
# OPTIONS: testing=AbortLoopVisits:10:0
# STATISTIC: LoopVisitsAborted >= 1
# RUN: walk f0 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: code f0:Body
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# ANSWERS: -2
